      "path": "Sanctem/README.md",
      "title": "README",
      "format": "md",
      "primary": true,
      "excerpt": "Sanctem Sanctem is an oriental wellness and healing brand. 中文定位：东方康养疗愈品牌。 Brand Main IP name: Sanctem Chinese description: 东方康养疗愈品牌 Main language: English System role: wellness, healing, hospitality, and restorative living under an oriental care sensibility. Business 康养疗愈 东方身心护理 旅居疗愈体验 品牌化健康服务 Voice Calm, precise, and restorative. Speak with quiet confidence. Avoid medical overclaims, heavy mysticism, and decorative ",
      "text": "# Sanctem\n\nSanctem is an oriental wellness and healing brand.\n\n中文定位：东方康养疗愈品牌。\n\n## Brand\n\n- Main IP name: Sanctem\n- Chinese description: 东方康养疗愈品牌\n- Main language: English\n- System role: wellness, healing, hospitality, and restorative living under an oriental care sensibility.\n\n## Business\n\n- 康养疗愈\n- 东方身心护理\n- 旅居疗愈体验\n- 品牌化健康服务\n\n## Voice\n\nCalm, precise, and restorative. Speak with quiet confidence. Avoid medical overclaims, heavy mysticism, and decorative wellness cliches.\n\n## Asset Structure\n\n- `assets/brand-images/` — public logo images exposed through the website/API build.\n- `assets/logos/` — original logo source files.\n\n",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"sanctem-guide-1-sanctem\">Sanctem</h1>\n<p>Sanctem is an oriental wellness and healing brand.</p>\n<p>中文定位：东方康养疗愈品牌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sanctem-guide-1-brand\">Brand</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Main IP name: Sanctem</li>\n<li>Chinese description: 东方康养疗愈品牌</li>\n<li>Main language: English</li>\n<li>System role: wellness, healing, hospitality, and restorative living under an oriental care sensibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sanctem-guide-1-business\">Business</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>康养疗愈</li>\n<li>东方身心护理</li>\n<li>旅居疗愈体验</li>\n<li>品牌化健康服务</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sanctem-guide-1-voice\">Voice</h2>\n<p>Calm, precise, and restorative. Speak with quiet confidence. Avoid medical overclaims, heavy mysticism, and decorative wellness cliches.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sanctem-guide-1-asset-structure\">Asset Structure</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>assets/brand-images/</code> — public logo images exposed through the website/API build.</li>\n<li><code>assets/logos/</code> — original logo source files.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    }
  ],
